            <title><![CDATA[Indictment sheds light on alleged Iran-backed plots across U.S. and Europe]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/indictment-sheds-light-on-alleged-iran-backed-plots-across-u-s-and-europe</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Iran's top national security official warned that it would strike American bases beyond the Gulf, including in Europe, if the United States resumes air strikes against the Islamic Republic. The warning comes one day after indictments in New York against three men who allegedly conspired to attack U.S. Air Force planes at a base in England. Nick Schifrin reports.]]></description>
