            <title><![CDATA[News Wrap: Democrat Scott Colom defeats Mississippi Sen. Cindy Hyde-Smith]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/news-wrap-democrat-scott-colom-defeats-mississippi-sen-cindy-hyde-smith</link>
            <description><![CDATA[In our news wrap Wednesday, Democrat Scott Colom has defeated incumbent Republican Sen. Cindy Hyde-Smith in Mississippi, a group that included Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth was admonished by an Army sentinel at the Tomb of the Unknown Soldier and peace talks between Ukraine, Russia and the U.S. ended with an agreement to exchange prisoners, but no breakthrough on ending the war.]]></description>
