            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/sen-coons-on-huang-affair-iran-war-and-why-trump-should-fire-hegseth</link>
            <description><![CDATA[As Democrats prepare to take control of Congress, Delaware Sen. Chris Coons is poised to become chairman of the Senate Foreign Relations Committee, succeeding retiring Democrat Jeanne Shaheen. A staunch supporter of Ukraine and a critic of President Trump's war with Iran, Coons would take the helm at a consequential moment for American foreign policy.  Coons joined Geoff Bennett to discuss more.]]></description>
